### 1. Transaction valide (250 EUR sur CUST-001)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "d54685ce-402e-4fba-9d80-faf83b179e15",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "merchantCategory": "GROCERY",
  "country": "MA"
}

### 2. Montant au-dessus du plafond de 1000 (attendu : 400)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "d54685ce-402e-4fba-9d80-faf83b179e15",
  "amount": 5000,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

